{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"19915","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/19915","key":"MC-273812","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"24/Jun/24 2:13 AM","customfield_10050":"1258067","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<div class=\"panel\" style=\"background-color: #ffffce;border-color: #cccccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #cccccc;background-color: #f7d6c1;\"><b>Moderator Note by <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=zTxrbq\" rel=\"noreferrer\">zTxrbq</a></b></div><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: #ffffce;\">\n<p>If you are coming from Mogswamp, please refrain from commenting here and asking Mojang to fix this. Comments are meant to provide new information, not as a petition forum for content creators. Comments like \"please fix this\" are spam; all comments containing feedback, complaints, change requests, no new info, and the like will be removed. Repeated violations may result in consequences to your bug tracker account.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p>Intersection loot chests in trial chambers only spawn with iron blocks, diamond, and cake instead of from the intended loot table. When running the /loot command it generates correctly, but not in the structures (see attached images).</p>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Generate the \"corridor/end_1\" trial chambers structure by using the command provided below.\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/place template minecraft:trial_chambers/corridor/end_1</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Open the chest below the stairs and observe how an iron block, a cake, and a diamond always generates.</li>\n</ol>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"24/Jun/24 9:17 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/35997","id":"35997","filename":"intersectionchest.jpg","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png"},"displayName":"migrated","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"24/Jun/24 2:11 AM","size":"31 kB","mimeType":"image/jpeg","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/35997","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/35997"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/35998","id":"35998","filename":"intersectionchest1.jpg","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d7016